        <mxCell id="off_queue" value="Offline Queue Provider:&#xa;• Track pending weighments (queued on save failure)&#xa;• Retry on connection restore (automatic)&#xa;• Breakdown: weighments, audit, operator_updates, sessions&#xa;• Last sync timestamp + success flag&#xa;• Manual sync trigger from status panel&#xa;• Retry count per item (exponential backoff)" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#27AE60;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#1e8449;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" parent="offline_group" vertex="1">
