        <mxCell id="off_conn" value="Connectivity Status:&#xa;• Green dot = online, Red dot = offline&#xa;• Badge count: pending items + alerts&#xa;• Status panel overlay (hover/click):&#xa;  ├─ Sync status per category&#xa;  ├─ Pending breakdown by type&#xa;  ├─ Last successful sync time&#xa;  ├─ Device stats (CPU / RAM / temperature)&#xa;  └─ &#39;Sync Now&#39; manual button" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#4DB8B8;fontColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#2D7B7B;fontSize=10;align=left;spacingLeft=10;" parent="offline_group" vertex="1">
